                    "I_occ = KL(ρ‖uniform) = 0.7513 nats — the deterministic chain that rules out coincidence.",
                    "https://github.com/MagusDraconis/AT/blob/feature/v2.2-new-physics/Docs/Research/ATQG_228.md"),
