                    "https://github.com/MagusDraconis/AT/blob/feature/v2.2-new-physics/Docs/ResearchY/D_ResonanceStructure/ResearchY-D_030.md"),
                new("ResearchY-NP_019", "INFORMATION COSMOLOGY AUDIT",
